        "title": "Nerve Recovery Max™ – Support Healthy Nerves & Daily Wellness",
        "meta_descr": "Nerve Recovery Max™ is a daily nutritional formula designed to support healthy nerve function, neurological wellness, cellular energy, and antioxidant protection. Its carefully selected nutrients complement a balanced lifestyle and provide convenient daily support for overall nerve health and vitality.",
        "header_custom": "",
